<title>SWITZERLAND: Hoechst said to get about 40pct of Clariant.</title>
<headline>Hoechst said to get about 40pct of Clariant.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemical company Hoechst AG will hold about 40 percent of Clariant AG after the Swiss group absorbs Hoechst's speciality chemicals business, an industry official close to the deal said.</p>
</text>
